# AI-Enhanced Development Platform - Capstone Project

## Project Overview

An intelligent development platform that combines AI-powered code review capabilities with collaborative decision-making tools, built upon proven ALX-poll and code review agent foundations.

## 🎯 Vision Statement

To create a comprehensive AI-assisted development ecosystem that enhances code quality, accelerates team decision-making, and provides intelligent insights throughout the software development lifecycle.

## 📋 Project Components

### Core Foundations
- **Code Review Agent** - AI-powered code analysis and quality assessment
- **ALX-Poll System** - Collaborative polling and decision-making platform

### Target Platform Features
- Automated code quality pipeline
- Real-time development feedback
- Team collaboration and consensus tools
- AI-assisted development workflows

